Package: fsv
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: 3D filesystem visualizer
 fsv displays the layout of a filesystem in three dimensions. Files and
 directories are represented as solid shapes whose size is proportional
 to disk usage, allowing large consumers of disk space to be spotted at
 a glance.
